{"name": "Miracle Brave", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique pixel art blends with bullet hell shooter gameplay, creating a distinct visual feast.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"648\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284660/extras/e14a59352e724cbbbd793834a19471a1.poster.avif?t=1775904500\" width=\"1152\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284660/extras/e14a59352e724cbbbd793834a19471a1.webm?t=1775904500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284660/extras/e14a59352e724cbbbd793834a19471a1.mp4?t=1775904500\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited inventory space and the intricate interplay between items based on their placement challenge players to master strategic loadouts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"648\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284660/extras/8f18539f023cffede07bee86d9706c97.poster.avif?t=1775904500\" width=\"1152\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284660/extras/8f18539f023cffede07bee86d9706c97.webm?t=1775904500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284660/extras/8f18539f023cffede07bee86d9706c97.mp4?t=1775904500\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A wealth of equipment and relics allows for free customization and the creation of your unique build, ensuring each run diverges from the last.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"648\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284660/extras/5dc2138dd1e46fff7d807a9368d59c4c.poster.avif?t=1775904500\" width=\"1152\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284660/extras/5dc2138dd1e46fff7d807a9368d59c4c.webm?t=1775904500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284660/extras/5dc2138dd1e46fff7d807a9368d59c4c.mp4?t=1775904500\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple playstyles converge \u2013 the fusion of tower defense and bullet hell action, plus the ability to marshal your own minion horde.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"648\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284660/extras/eae211d2fb69e60aa38ede537d0e8b1d.poster.avif?t=1775904500\" width=\"1152\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284660/extras/eae211d2fb69e60aa38ede537d0e8b1d.webm?t=1775904500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284660/extras/eae211d2fb69e60aa38ede537d0e8b1d.mp4?t=1775904500\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Miracle Brave blends inventory management, deck-building, tower defense, and shooter combat! Strategize your gear, forge your unique build from countless progression paths, take control of your hero, and hold back endless waves of beasts. Carve out your path to victory and forge your own legend!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_ite